(key: "arcane-trickster/surprise-spells", blueprint: "de5cb97a702699841abd3fc66c69fbcf", name: "Surprise Spells", summary: "Damaging spells add your sneak attack damage, once per spell, to flat-footed targets (area spells too); halved if the target saves for half.", guide: "prestige-classes#surprise-spells")
